    "problems": "The study uses a single 8B base model and one mid-training corpus; it has no random or third-domain control. The SFT helpfulness dataset has acknowledged quality limitations. GRPO domain is confounded with reward-model identity. A single judge scores all evaluations, multilingual judgments may be less calibrated, and per-dimension comparisons lack multiple-comparisons correction.",
